<para id="RM000003089000X" category="J" type-id="8038V" name-id="950UU-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>ABS/VSC ECU Communication Stop Mode</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000003089000X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000077800000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>ABS/VSC ECU Communication Stop Mode</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>"ABS/VSC" is not displayed on the "CAN Bus Connected ECU Check" screen of TaSCAN</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Applies to "ABS/VSC ECU Communication Stop Mode" in the DTC combination table</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<ptxt/>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly (VSC ECU) branch line open or connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly (VSC ECU) power source system malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly (VSC ECU) internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000003089000X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3K00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B162430J01" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000003089000X_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___000077900000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>When measuring the resistance of the CAN bus, turn the IG OFF, check that the warning function is not operating, and leave the vehicle for 1 minutes or more without operating the key or switches or opening/closing the doors before starting the measurement. If a door needs to be opened during the inspection, open it beforehand.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When inspecting each connector, before disconnecting the connector, push the connector case in the connecting direction and check that the connector is not loose or disconnected.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When disconnecting a connector, check that the connector terminals and connector case are free of damage, deformation, corrosion, etc.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000003089000X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000003089000X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000077A00000">
<testtitle>Check CAN Bus for Open Circuit (ABS/VSC ECU Branch Wire)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly (VSC ECU) connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146352J07" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly (VSC ECU) vehicle harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.10in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>25(CANH) - 15(CANL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>54 to 69Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000003089000X_04_0002" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000003089000X_04_0004" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000003089000X_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___000077B00000">
