<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146352J09" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly (VSC ECU) vehicle harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.90in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.11in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
